  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ヒスイの地に　敷かれし　湿地の土こそ頑丈なる体躯と　泥炭を　自在に　扱う新たな　器量　もたらしたと　考察す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "히스이 땅에 펼쳐진 습지의 토양 덕분에 튼튼한 몸과 함께, 이탄을 자유롭게 다루는 새로운 재주를 익히게 된 것으로 추측된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "考察結果顯示，正是遍布在洗翠大地上的濕地土壤，造就了牠堅實的軀體和自在運用泥炭的新能力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Je pense que ce sont les étendues marécageuses de Hisui qui ont doté ce Pokémon d’un corps robuste et d’une aptitude à manipuler la tourbe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vermutlich ist das sumpfige Gelände Hisuis der Grund für seine robuste Statur sowie die neu errungene Fähigkeit, Torf nach Belieben manipulieren zu können.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tengo la teoría de que el terreno pantanoso de Hisui favoreció el desarrollo de su constitución robusta, así como su capacidad de manipular la turba a voluntad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ritengo che sia stato il terreno palustre di Hisui ad averlo reso nerboruto e ad avergli donato la facoltà di manipolare la torba a suo piacere.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I believe it was Hisui’s swampy terrain that gave Ursaluna its burly physique and newfound capacity to manipulate peat at will.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ヒスイの地に　敷かれし　湿地の土こそ頑丈なる体躯と　泥炭を　自在に　扱う新たな　器量　もたらしたと　考察す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "考察结果显示，正是遍布在洗翠大地上的湿地土壤，造就了它坚实的躯体和自在运用泥炭的新能力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tengo la teoría de que el terreno pantanoso de Hisui favoreció el desarrollo de su constitución robusta, así como su capacidad de manipular la turba a voluntad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "うみを　わたり　ながれついた　とちでいきぬいた　けっか　とくべつなすがたと　のうりょくに　へんかした。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "바다를 건너 표착한 땅에서 살아온 결과, 특별한 모습과 능력으로 변화했다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在飄洋過海到達的土地上努力生存下來的結果，使牠擁有了特別的樣子和能力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a traversé la mer pour rejoindre un nouveau territoire. Le fait d’avoir réussi à y survivre a altéré son apparence et ses compétences.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es überquerte den Ozean und erreichte fremdes Land, wo es ums Überleben kämpfte und dabei besondere Fertigkeiten und Merkmale erlangte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha desarrollado unas capacidades y un aspecto especiales tras haber sobrevivido en la tierra donde recaló al atravesar el mar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha attraversato il mare approdando in una nuova terra dove, riuscendo a non soccombere, ha sviluppato un aspetto e delle capacità insoliti.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It crossed the sea and drifted ashore in a new land. Surviving in this place led it to take on a unique appearance and gain special powers.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "海を　渡り　流れ着いた　土地で生き抜いた　結果　特別な姿と　能力に　変化した。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在飘洋过海所到达的土地上存活下来的结果，让它的样子和能力起了特别的变化。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha desarrollado unas capacidades y un aspecto especiales tras haber sobrevivido en la tierra donde recaló al atravesar el mar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "てつのように　かたい　どろで　みをまもり　やみを　みとおす　ひだりめをもつ　とくべつな　ガチグマ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "쇠처럼 단단해진 진흙으로 몸을 보호하며 어둠 속도 내다보는 왼쪽 눈을 가진 특별한 다투곰.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用堅硬如鐵的泥巴保護身體，且擁有能夠看穿黑暗的左眼。是特別的月月熊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cet Ursaking singulier peut voir dans l’obscurité grâce à son œil gauche. De la boue aussi dure que le fer protège son corps.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses besondere Ursaluna schützt seinen Körper mit Schlamm, der mit der Zeit stahlhart wurde. Sein linkes Auge kann selbst im Dunkeln sehen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Ursaluna tan particular se protege el cuerpo con una capa de barro tan dura como el hierro. Su ojo izquierdo le permite ver en la oscuridad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Questo insolito Ursaluna protegge il corpo con del fango indurito, robusto come ferro. Il suo occhio sinistro è in grado di vedere nell’oscurità.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
